{"3973920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moon's Curse", "steam_appid": 3973920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped under the curse of the Moon, Isabella — the last survivor of the ruined town of Meaford — carries a dark secret she can barely control. By day, she fights to rebuild and protect a fragile new settlement. By night, the curse awakens, turning her into a monstrous werewolf that hungers for destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Moon’s Curse</strong>, you must balance two lives:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Fight:</strong> Classic <i>Metroidvania</i> action with branching paths, brutal enemies, and abilities earned through exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Protect:</strong> Help the town grow, gather resources, and strengthen its defenses against outside threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide Your Curse:</strong> The townsfolk look to you as their savior — but if they discover your monstrous side, everything you’ve built could collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Isabella master the curse and defend her people… or lose herself to the beast within?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped under the curse of the Moon, Isabella — the last survivor of the ruined town of Meaford — carries a dark secret she can barely control. By day, she fights to rebuild and protect a fragile new settlement. By night, the curse awakens, turning her into a monstrous werewolf that hungers for destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Moon’s Curse</strong>, you must balance two lives:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Fight:</strong> Classic <i>Metroidvania</i> action with branching paths, brutal enemies, and abilities earned through exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><st